---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — DekhoYahan" description="Why DekhoYahan exists.">
  <section class="content-page shell">
    <p class="section-kicker">About</p>
    <h1>Some things make more sense when you can <em>see them happen.</em></h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>DekhoYahan is a small project for curious people.</p>
      <p>We pick things that are already around us, or are starting to become part of everyday life. Then we try to show what is actually happening in a way that is easy to follow.</p>

      <h2>Why build it?</h2>
      <p>You can read about almost anything. You can watch thousands of videos. But sometimes an idea still does not stick.</p>
      <p>We want to build explanations you can see, move through and interact with — without making them feel like school or a game.</p>

      <h2>Who is it for?</h2>
      <p>Anyone who is curious. A school student should be able to follow it. An adult should not feel talked down to. And someone technical should still be able to look deeper.</p>

      <div class="plain-note">DekhoYahan is free while we build and learn what people find useful.</div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
